<title>GERMANY: Kohl stands by goal of halving joblessness by 2000.</title>
<headline>Kohl stands by goal of halving joblessness by 2000.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chancellor Helmut Kohl affirmed on Friday that his government stands by its goal of halving unemployment in Germany by the end of the decade.</p>
<p>&quot;We will halve unemployment by the end of the decade,&quot; Kohl told parliament. &quot;It is an ambitious goal and no one can do all that alone. Everyone has to work together towards that goal -- unions, employers and government.&quot;</p>
</text>
